## How long ago something was: "Changed { $ago }".

time-just-now = अभी-अभी
time-minutes-ago = { $count ->
    [one] एक मिनट पहले
   *[other] { $count } मिनट पहले
}
time-hours-ago = { $count ->
    [one] एक घंटे पहले
   *[other] { $count } घंटे पहले
}
time-yesterday = कल
time-days-ago = { $count } दिन पहले
